OL,3,GNEWSACare home and charity charged over
OL,4,Aboat deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home and charitable trust have
OL,7,Fbeen charged with corporate
OL,8,Fmanslaughter after two people drowned
OL,9,Fwhen a leaking boat capsized during a
OL,10,Fday trip.
OL,12,FA "wheelyboat" designed for wheelchair
OL,13,Fusers capsized on Roadford Lake, near
OL,14,FOkehampton, Devon, on 8 June 2022
OL,15,Fresulting in six people entering the
OL,16,Fwater.
OL,18,FAlex Wood, 43, and Alison "Ali"
OL,19,FTilsley, 63, both from west Devon, died
OL,20,Fwhile a woman in her 50s was seriously
OL,21,Finjured.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
